'''Eclipse''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
The whole knife is black, but imprinted on the blade is a solar eclipse with an illuminating orange backlight, hence the name.

